Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.02,0:00:06.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did you arrange for him too, Mason-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.10,0:00:10.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The only time I frightened you\Nwas three years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.11,0:00:12.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We couldn't have you dying out here,\Nso I came to keep watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.86,0:00:14.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then why did you attack us?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.19,0:00:18.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That was because Izumi-san \Ntold me to toughen you up a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.78,0:00:19.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You've got to be kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.03,0:00:22.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That wasn't "a little,"\Nwe were at death's door!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.53,0:00:24.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's right! How could you have been so reckless with children?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.37,0:00:28.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Enough! Stop griping about\Nsomething that happened ages ago!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.25,0:00:29.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.75,0:00:32.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sensei?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.13,0:00:34.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's just a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.71,0:00:38.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He probably just stole his parents' boat or something and drifted here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.93,0:00:39.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If that's the case—
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.22,0:00:43.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sensei!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.27,0:00:49.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother! That light!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.40,0:00:51.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's an alchemist!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.52,0:00:51.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ed!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.44,0:00:56.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why, you...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.74,0:01:03.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You turned your \Nown body into stone?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.63,0:01:15.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wh-What's with this guy?!\NWhere are his clothes?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.93,0:01:21.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?!\NHe's just a child, you know!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.14,0:01:25.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But he might have been\Ncoming after us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.31,0:01:28.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Coming after you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.14,0:01:31.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,At your ages, are you already such wanted men?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.44,0:01:32.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm not kidding around.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.57,0:01:37.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where did you come from? Where are your parents?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.90,0:01:39.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.28,0:01:40.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.95,0:01:42.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.99,0:01:45.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't know anything...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.50,0:01:51.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There, there,\Nyou don't have to cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.96,0:01:53.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're all right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.01,0:02:09.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Man cannot obtain anything\Nwithout first sacrificing something.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.68,0:02:14.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In order to obtain anything,\Nsomething of equal value is required.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.02,0:02:19.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That is alchemy's\NLaw of Equivalent Exchange.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.78,0:02:25.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,At the time, we believed that\Nto be the true way of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.56,0:04:19.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Those haven't been cooked yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.69,0:04:27.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Still, I'm glad that you two made it back alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.65,0:04:29.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't go killing us off so easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.57,0:04:32.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.24,0:04:33.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Has your teacher forgiven you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.70,0:04:37.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's probably going to be difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.50,0:04:42.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We disobeyed what she taught us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.84,0:04:48.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even though we knew we were nothing more than one part of the flow of the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.76,0:04:51.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,we became conceited, saying that the world was within us, too,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.01,0:04:53.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and tried to alter that flow.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.31,0:04:57.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's something\Nshe'll never forgive us for.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.39,0:05:01.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shoot! Let go of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.19,0:05:02.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come on!\NLet go of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.15,0:05:07.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Take it easy on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.66,0:05:14.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's something funny about that!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.29,0:05:17.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Everybody makes mistakes, don't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.70,0:05:18.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm going to go tell her off!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.21,0:05:21.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll ask her if she's never\Nmade any mistakes before.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.04,0:05:24.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hold on, Winry! That's all right!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.63,0:05:27.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sensei realizes that much.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.68,0:05:33.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So don't worry, Winry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.93,0:05:37.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I suppose...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.06,0:05:40.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So, what are you going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.94,0:05:42.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hmm, I'm not sure...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.90,0:05:44.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,About that boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.23,0:05:50.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even if he has lost his memory,\NSensei trusts him too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.15,0:05:53.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But she did take him\Nto the police, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.87,0:05:55.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They asked her to watch after him while they gathered information.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.12,0:05:59.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I hope he's just a lost little boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.92,0:06:08.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The meat is too tough!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.60,0:06:20.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'd better not do this, Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.06,0:06:23.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sensei locked it with alchemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.65,0:06:25.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If we open it, she'll know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.56,0:06:26.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In that case...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.11,0:06:35.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al, make sure to put this back the way it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.04,0:06:44.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wanna play?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.08,0:06:46.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Terrific!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.29,0:06:48.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Everyone was dead,\Nso it got boring.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.67,0:06:53.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They aren't dead.\NThey're just asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.59,0:06:54.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What should we play?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.80,0:06:56.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.81,0:07:02.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Look! You played around like this, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.56,0:07:11.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So, it {\i1}was{\i0} you who watched us\Nthat whole time, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.28,0:07:14.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where did you come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.12,0:07:22.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, let it go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.08,0:07:22.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.21,0:07:25.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,An animal's life is not a plaything.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.67,0:07:27.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm playing! I'm playing! I'm playing!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.59,0:07:30.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,H-Hey, be quiet!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.21,0:07:29.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You'll wake them up!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.09,0:07:31.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah, dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.43,0:07:40.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Incredible! Incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.72,0:07:43.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can do that too, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.60,0:07:45.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't lie to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.77,0:07:47.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Earlier on the island,\Nyou transmuted a rock!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.73,0:07:49.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your clothes were also made by transmutation, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.07,0:07:51.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother, your tone...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.82,0:07:53.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al, you saw it, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.90,0:07:56.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This guy transmuted without using a transmutation circle.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.20,0:07:58.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The only ones who can do that are myself and Sensei.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.12,0:08:02.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And yet, Sensei pretended like she didn't see anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.54,0:08:03.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's definitely weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.91,0:08:05.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.50,0:08:07.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Try untying it with alchemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.04,0:08:10.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Take it off, take it off, take it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.25,0:08:14.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother, this boy really doesn't have anything to do with those others.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.92,0:08:18.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al, I remember having seen his face before.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.68,0:08:20.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's as though I've\Nseen him somewhere...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.94,0:08:36.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother! What'd you do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.95,0:08:38.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I didn't do anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.16,0:08:42.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's no way I could transmute a person's body and a bed together in the first place!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.49,0:08:47.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're making too much noise for me to sleep!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.00,0:08:51.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.84,0:08:55.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, no, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.92,0:08:58.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It wasn't like that, Sensei! We didn't do anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.51,0:08:59.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's true!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.76,0:09:02.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother is quite the liar, but he's telling the truth today!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.47,0:09:04.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al, thanks a lot...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.18,0:09:07.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.27,0:09:10.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't remember having taught you\Nany such careless alchemy as this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.27,0:09:13.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Making Chimeras by crossing two lives with each other aside, that is...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.82,0:09:17.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let me down! Let me down from here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.40,0:09:18.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stop crying!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.11,0:09:22.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.57,0:09:24.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can you remember what your original form was?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.70,0:09:28.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You just have to remember\Nwhat your original form was.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.62,0:09:31.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Take your time... Take your time...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.56,0:09:49.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You moronic pupils!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.89,0:09:53.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What kind of commotion were you\Ntrying to create by scaring this child?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.48,0:09:55.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're sorry, Sensei!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.77,0:09:57.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But we were worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.86,0:10:00.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What if he was the guy\Nwho came after us?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.28,0:10:03.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just who is it that's after you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.04,0:10:10.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They called themselves... homunculi.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.30,0:10:26.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you for always\Ncoming by like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.60,0:10:28.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But with your new job, are you sure it's okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.85,0:10:32.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes. I work at home,\Nso my time is free.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.36,0:10:41.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Scieszka-san, um, if you're still investigating the incident with Maes...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.11,0:10:42.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.15,0:10:44.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm not involved in\Nanything that dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.91,0:10:48.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm not all that impulsive, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.91,0:10:50.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bye-bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.04,0:10:53.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, if you'll excuse me...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.96,0:10:53.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,See you tomorrow, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.88,0:11:00.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hold on! Just a minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.18,0:11:05.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Colonel...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.26,0:11:11.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ow-ow-ow-ow...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.98,0:11:17.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Aren't you going to Hughes-san's house?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.36,0:11:20.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is it wrong of me to slip over to a close friend's home?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.61,0:11:22.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's no way you can\Nshow your face there, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.74,0:11:25.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not when you aren't even investigating the cause of that close friend's death
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.78,0:11:28.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and can only think about\Ngetting yourself promoted.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.49,0:11:30.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now look, missy...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.74,0:11:33.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,These are copies of the materials
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.16,0:11:35.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,that Hughes-san was looking into\Nright before he died.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.29,0:11:39.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The reason that he was killed\Nhas to be in there somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.47,0:11:46.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Congratulations on your posting to Central!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.05,0:11:53.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That was easy for me to say, but I don't get this at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.31,0:11:59.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is a list of all the external calls that were connected to the Central Command Center.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.94,0:12:02.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's no sort of code here...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.53,0:12:05.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,To the reception clerk...\NTo the Ministry of Justice...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.78,0:12:08.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,To the Führer's secretary's office...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.49,0:12:11.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.45,0:12:15.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't have you lose\Ntrack of them, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.16,0:12:18.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm pretty busy myself here, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.76,0:12:26.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Their master lives in\Na town named Dublith.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.59,0:12:29.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They might still be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.76,0:12:31.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe I should go there\Nand have a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.76,0:12:35.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It'll be okay to leave the Greed matter to Lust and Gluttony, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.85,0:12:36.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.98,0:12:39.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Those boys still haven't given up on the Philosopher's Stone yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.36,0:12:42.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Arrange for them to have the opportunity to create one once again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.61,0:12:45.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,For being the youngest among us,\Nyou sure do give orders like you're all grown up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.11,0:12:49.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I would like to have those boys create a Philosopher's Stone,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.28,0:12:53.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but we can't have them sticking their noses into that Ishbal business.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.37,0:12:54.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Understood?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.00,0:13:04.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why don't those homunculi create their own Philosopher's Stone?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.09,0:13:07.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They said that they couldn't make it themselves—
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.67,0:13:09.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,that they couldn't use alchemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.64,0:13:12.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In that case, this child is different.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.14,0:13:14.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That is true.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.18,0:13:17.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But you shouldn't be able to reform your own body,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.23,0:13:20.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,no matter what kind of alchemy you're using, and yet he can.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.06,0:13:23.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's more, he has transmuted without a transmutation circle
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.65,0:13:26.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,just like you and Brother do.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.03,0:13:26.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's—
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.94,0:13:28.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al! Not that...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.65,0:13:32.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al, don't you remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.28,0:13:33.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Remember what?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.58,0:13:37.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ed, you remember, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.71,0:13:40.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The gateway, you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.72,0:13:51.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sure enough,\Nit's because I saw it...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.89,0:13:53.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It was truth, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.97,0:13:55.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Truth?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.93,0:13:57.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.52,0:14:00.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.62,0:14:18.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,At the time, I couldn't understand what was going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.33,0:14:23.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It was as if there was this incredible amount of information being directly mashed into my brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.33,0:14:26.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But then, suddenly I understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.84,0:14:31.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Everything about alchemy that I hadn't known up until then...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.63,0:14:36.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It felt like I was just\None step away from arriving\Nat my imperfect theory of human transmutation.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.81,0:14:41.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.77,0:14:47.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stop it! Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.32,0:14:49.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.41,0:15:02.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.54,0:15:04.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,One more time!\NShow it to me one more time!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.67,0:15:06.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The truth was in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.38,0:15:07.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The thing that I've been looking for!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.50,0:15:12.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Equivalent exchange?\NWhat do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.01,0:15:14.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A toll?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.06,0:15:22.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.93,0:15:24.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's been taken away!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.98,0:15:26.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.78,0:15:41.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No... This isn't what I wanted...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.79,0:15:44.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al, it's all my fault...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.54,0:15:45.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.71,0:15:49.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I understood when I was inside that gateway.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.92,0:15:51.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If I acted now, there was still time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.30,0:15:53.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If I acted now, I could still...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.38,0:15:57.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Give him back. He's my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.89,0:16:02.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My leg...\NBoth my arms... My heart... I'll give them to you...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.22,0:16:04.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just give him back!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.02,0:16:07.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's my only brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.91,0:16:22.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.04,0:16:25.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.92,0:16:35.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,By the time I came to, \NI was already in this body,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.01,0:16:38.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and what had been Mom was no longer there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.39,0:16:41.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I saw the truth there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.60,0:16:46.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's why I can transmute without a transmutation circle\Nand was able to bond Al's soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.98,0:16:47.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Isn't that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.94,0:16:51.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You think of it as truth, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.69,0:16:54.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, it is, isn't it? I...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.28,0:16:57.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It was more along the lines of a magic trick, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.53,0:17:02.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sensei, I just remembered.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.95,0:17:05.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I have a hunch that I saw him there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.66,0:17:07.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If that's so, then he isn't human!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.62,0:17:09.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's something else!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.17,0:17:12.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's something I need to check. Everything else comes afterward.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.79,0:17:12.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sensei!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.75,0:17:16.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I forbid you to go near\Nthat child.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.17,0:17:18.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Got that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.84,0:17:20.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Izumi...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.84,0:17:21.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.18,0:17:24.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm just going to go make sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.35,0:17:27.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please, let me go alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.56,0:17:30.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Those boys don't know, do they?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.48,0:17:33.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How homunculi are born.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.61,0:17:42.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Gentlemen!\NHow good of you to come!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.03,0:17:47.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I, Alex Louis Armstrong, \Nwelcome you with my utmost!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.79,0:17:52.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stop fooling around\Nand get to work!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.63,0:17:54.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lieutenant Breda...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.38,0:17:59.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Still, you never know when he's\Ngoing to strike.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.88,0:18:00.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brace yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.59,0:18:03.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The major isn't here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.93,0:18:05.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.64,0:18:07.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's with the officer assigned to the Court-Martial Office
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.64,0:18:10.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,who has taken over for\NBrigadier General Hughes,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.85,0:18:12.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and they're off conducting\Nan investigation somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.81,0:18:14.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who is this other person\Nwho's taking over for him?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.65,0:18:17.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As I recall, it was Frank...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.86,0:18:19.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You mean Lt. Colonel Frank Archer?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.57,0:18:21.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you know him?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.24,0:18:27.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's a man dedicated to his military duties.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.87,0:18:27.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's a good thing to be, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.24,0:18:32.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,By military duties, \NI mean that the man enjoys war.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.96,0:18:41.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lt. Colonel,\NI'm sorry to ask you again...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.76,0:18:44.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't know where the Elric brothers went.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.93,0:18:46.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you, a broken record?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.26,0:18:48.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's no evidence that they even went south.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.60,0:18:51.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It is evident that they went south.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.64,0:18:53.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You have someone watching them?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.64,0:18:55.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Those brothers are not traitors!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.69,0:18:56.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Perhaps.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.98,0:19:01.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I just don't have any intention of letting them run around free, the way Mustang does.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.61,0:19:05.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,For the sake of the forthcoming battle,\Nyou understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.78,0:19:08.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry about this,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.24,0:19:12.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but Izumi-san told me not to let you out, no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.46,0:19:15.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So, where did she go?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.54,0:19:15.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Beats me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.88,0:19:18.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She asked to have a boat ready for her,\Nso maybe the island again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.92,0:19:20.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The island? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.96,0:19:23.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you doing, Al?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.51,0:19:24.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.72,0:19:26.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All righty...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.47,0:19:28.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There, let's let your hair out, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.18,0:19:35.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Winry, sorry, but since we can't come out of our room...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.35,0:19:36.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.44,0:19:38.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What did you guys do to this boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.65,0:19:40.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's terrified of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.69,0:19:41.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.86,0:19:44.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Anyhow, Winry, this may sound strange,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.86,0:19:46.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but there's something\NI need to ask you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.45,0:19:47.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's about that boy's body.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.12,0:19:49.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al, what are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.03,0:19:51.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You mean this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.16,0:19:52.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I was surprised too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.95,0:19:54.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What in the world could have happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.00,0:19:56.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,At the base of his right arm\Nand left leg...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.59,0:20:02.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.17,0:20:05.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,what are you trying to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.80,0:20:08.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother, you said you saw it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.68,0:20:11.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,His face, on the other side of the doorway?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.56,0:20:16.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's going on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.02,0:20:20.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Th-This isn't good.\NIf Izumi-san finds out...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.65,0:20:22.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll be finished right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.61,0:20:25.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.15,0:20:26.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your teacher told you\Nnot to come near this boy, didn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.70,0:20:29.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Like he said, we'll be \Nfinished with this right away!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.95,0:20:36.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's no way...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.79,0:20:39.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,something like this could be, right?\NIt was an equivalent exchange...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.17,0:20:43.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mom's body, in exchange for my leg...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.34,0:20:47.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al's soul, as it was fading away, in exchange for my arm...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.09,0:20:49.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It was an equivalent exchange!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.35,0:20:59.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where did you get this scar?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.44,0:21:03.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's the scar from a fox bite...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.03,0:21:06.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is this my arm?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.41,0:21:13.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait! Ed!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.16,0:21:17.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Edward!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.62,0:21:19.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Could it be...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.71,0:21:23.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Could it be that that boy's arm and leg are...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.26,0:23:40.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Fullmetal Alchemist{\i0}...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.93,0:23:44.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Episode 30: "Assault on South Headquarters"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.40,0:23:48.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sensei,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.40,0:23:50.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I am still a dog of the military!
